otek-perfex-linux-tracker (0.1.9) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed a duplicate window/tray icon bug: relaunching the app while an
    instance was already running (visible or hidden in the tray) built a
    second PerfexTrackerWindow and a second tray_helper.py subprocess
    instead of re-presenting the existing window. do_activate() now
    checks for an existing window first and simply presents it.

 -- Ömer Teknoloji <support@otek.today>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

